"след сканиране на картата или избиране на името си."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:382
msgid ""
"In the absence of a scanner, click the :icon:`fa-barcode` icon "
"(:guilabel:`barcode`) to scan barcodes using your device's webcam."
msgstr ""
