"terminals/stripe>` или :doc:`Viva.com <../payment_methods/terminals/"
"viva_com>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:122
msgid ""
"To pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>`, customers "
"must scan the displayed QR code."
msgstr ""
"За да платят :doc:`онлайн </applications/finance/payment_providers>`, "
"клиентите трябва да сканират показания QR код."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Cash` payments are not supported."
msgstr ":guilabel:`В брой` плащания не се поддържат."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:127
msgid ""
"Regardless of the self-ordering configuration, only one :guilabel:`Online "
