#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:131
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Payment Methods` to :doc:`create or "
"edit payment methods <../payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Методи на плащане`, за "
