msgstr "Свързване на IoT система"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:22
msgid ""
"Link your POS to an IoT system to connect and coordinate hardware "
"peripherals like printers, scales, and scanners."
msgstr ""
"Свържете вашия POS с IoT система, за да свържете и координирате хардуерни "
"периферни устройства като принтери, везни и скенери."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers.rst:5
msgid "Receipt printers"
msgstr "Принтери за касови бележки"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:28
msgid ""
"Configure directly supported printers and identify which models require an "
"IoT system for connection."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте директно поддържаните принтери и определете кои модели "
"изискват IoT система за свързване."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:3
msgid "Electronic shelf labels"
msgstr "Електронни етикети за рафтове"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:34
msgid ""
"Integrate with the Pricer platform to configure and update digital shelf "
"labels."
msgstr ""
"Интегрирайте се с платформата Pricer, за да конфигурирате и актуализирате "
"дигитални етикети за рафтове."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:39
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/customer_display.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_iot.rst:31
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:283
msgid "Customer display"
msgstr "Дисплей за клиенти"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:39
msgid ""
"Set up a secondary screen to show order details and prices to customers "
"during checkout."
msgstr ""
"Настройте втори екран, който да показва детайлите на поръчката и цените на "
"клиентите по време на плащане."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_iot.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:3
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Везна"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:44
msgid ""
"Configure and use scales in the POS, including settings for European legal "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте и използвайте везни в POS, включително настройки за "
"европейските законови изисквания."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:49
