#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:165
msgid "Select a pricelist in the :guilabel:`Pricer Sales Pricelist` field."
msgstr "Изберете ценова листа в полето :guilabel:`Pricer Sales Pricelist`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:167
msgid ""
"Once a pricelist is set, the :guilabel:`On Sale Price` field appears, "
"showing the :guilabel:`Sales Price` with the discount applied."
msgstr ""
"След като бъде зададена ценова листа, се появява полето :guilabel:`On Sale "
"Price`, показващо :guilabel:`Sales Price` с приложената отстъпка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:170
msgid "Linking a pricelist to a product variant"
msgstr "Свързване на ценова листа с продуктов вариант"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:173
msgid ""
"After updating your electronic labels, a `PROMO` tag should appear on the "
"electronic label, displaying both the old, crossed-out price and the "
"discounted price."
msgstr ""
"След обновяване на вашите електронни етикети, върху електронния етикет "
"трябва да се появи етикет `PROMO`, показващ както старата, зачертана цена, "
"така и намалената цена."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:177
msgid ""
"Currently, pricelists that offer discounts for purchasing multiple units or "
"derive their prices from other pricelists are not supported."
msgstr ""
"В момента не се поддържат ценови листи, които предлагат отстъпки за "
"закупуване на множество единици или извеждат цените си от други ценови листи."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:179
msgid ""
"Assigning a pricelist to a product variant only affects the electronic label "
"display. Scanning the product at the point of sale does not automatically "
"apply the discount."
msgstr ""
"Задаването на ценова листа на продуктов вариант засяга само показването на "
"електронния етикет. Сканирането на продукта на мястото на продажба не "
"прилага автоматично отстъпката."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/electronic_labels.rst:183
msgid ":ref:`pos/pricing/discounts`"
msgstr ":ref:`pos/pricing/discounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:8
msgid ""
"Since the `Chromium 142 update <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142>`_, using a self-signed certificate is no longer required. The "
"recommended approach is to use the :doc:`Local Network Access <pos_lna>` "
"method instead."
msgstr ""
"От `актуализацията на Chromium 142 <https://developer.chrome.com/release-"
"notes/142>`_ насам, използването на самоподписан сертификат вече не е "
"необходимо. Препоръчителният подход е вместо това да се използва "
"методът :doc:`Local Network Access <pos_lna>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:12
msgid ""
"To work with Odoo, some printer models that can be used without an :doc:`IoT "
"system </applications/general/iot>` may require the HTTPS protocol to "
"establish a secure connection between the browser and the printer. However, "
"trying to reach the printer's IP address using HTTPS results in a warning "
"page in most web browsers. Force the connection to establish an HTTPS link "
"and enable the printer in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"За да работят с Odoo, някои модели принтери, които могат да се използват "
"без :doc:`IoT система </applications/general/iot>`, може да изискват HTTPS "
"протокол за установяване на защитена връзка между браузъра и принтера. "
"Опитът за достигане на IP адреса на принтера чрез HTTPS обаче води до "
"предупредителна страница в повечето уеб браузъри. Принудете връзката, за да "
"установите HTTPS връзка и активирате принтера в Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:21
msgid "Generation, export, and import of self-signed certificates"
msgstr "Генериране, експортиране и импортиране на самоподписани сертификати"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:23
msgid ""
"Printers that operate without an :doc:`IoT system </applications/general/"
"iot>` still require secure communication, which can be achieved "
"by :ref:`generating <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-generation>`, :ref:`exporting "
"<pos/epos-ssc/certificate-export>`, and/or :ref:`importing <pos/epos-ssc/"
"certificate-import>` a self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"Принтерите, които работят без :doc:`IoT система </applications/general/"
"iot>`, все пак изискват защитена комуникация, която може да се постигне "
"чрез :ref:`генериране <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-"
"generation>`, :ref:`експортиране <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-export>` и/"
"или :ref:`импортиране <pos/epos-ssc/certificate-import>` на самоподписан "
"сертификат."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:29
msgid ""
"Generating a self-signed certificate should only be done **once**. Creating "
"another certificate causes devices using the previous one to lose HTTPS "
"access."
msgstr ""
"Генерирането на самоподписан сертификат трябва да се прави само **веднъж**. "
"Създаването на друг сертификат кара устройствата, използващи предишния, да "
"загубят HTTPS достъп."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:31
msgid ""
"Printers that use an :doc:`IoT system </applications/general/iot>` do not "
"need a self-signed certificate, as the IoT box generates it automatically."
msgstr ""
"Принтерите, които използват :doc:`IoT система </applications/general/iot>`, "
"не се нуждаят от самоподписан сертификат, тъй като IoT кутията го генерира "
"автоматично."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:33
msgid ""
"For stable results, it is strongly recommended to use the Google Chrome "
"browser to generate the self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"За стабилни резултати силно се препоръчва да използвате браузъра Google "
"Chrome за генериране на самоподписания сертификат."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:37
msgid ""
"To export self-signed certificates from an operating system or a web browser "
"that is not mentioned in this documentation, search for `export SSL "
"certificate` and the name of your browser or operating system in the "
"preferred search engine. Similarly, to import self-signed certificates, "
"search for `import SSL certificate root authority` in the preferred search "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"За да експортирате самоподписани сертификати от операционна система или уеб "
"браузър, който не е споменат в тази документация, потърсете `export SSL "
"certificate` и името на вашия браузър или операционна система в "
"предпочитаната от вас търсачка. По подобен начин, за да импортирате "
"самоподписани сертификати, потърсете `import SSL certificate root authority` "
"в предпочитаната от вас търсачка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:45
msgid "Self-signed certificate generation"
msgstr "Генериране на самоподписан сертификат"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:47
msgid ""
"The generation process depends on the :abbr:`OS (Operating System)` and the "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Процесът на генериране зависи от :abbr:`OS (Operating System)` и браузъра."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:51
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:101
msgid "Windows 10 & Linux"
msgstr "Windows 10 и Linux"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:53
msgid ""
"To generate a self-signed certificate on **Google Chrome**, follow the next "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"За да генерирате самоподписан сертификат в **Google Chrome**, следвайте "
"следните стъпки:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:137
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:153
msgid ""
"Open the browser, type the printer's IP address in the search bar (e.g., "
"`https://192.168.1.25`), and press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"Отворете браузъра, въведете IP адреса на принтера в лентата за търсене "
"(напр. `https://192.168.1.25`) и натиснете `Enter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:139
msgid ""
"On the security warning page, click :guilabel:`Advanced`, "
"then :guilabel:`Proceed to [IP address] (unsafe)` to force the connection."
msgstr ""
"На страницата с предупреждение за сигурност кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Advanced`, след това върху :guilabel:`Proceed to [IP "
"address] (unsafe)`, за да принудите връзката."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:59
msgid ""
"On the EPSON platform, click :guilabel:`Advanced Settings`, "
"then :guilabel:`Administrator Login` to log in to the printer's homepage."
msgstr ""
"На платформата на EPSON кликнете върху :guilabel:`Advanced Settings`, след "
"това върху :guilabel:`Administrator Login`, за да влезете в началната "
"страница на принтера."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:61
msgid ""
"Type the initial password located at the back of the printer in "
"the :guilabel:`Current Password` field, then press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"Въведете първоначалната парола, намираща се на гърба на принтера, в "
"полето :guilabel:`Current Password`, след което натиснете `Enter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:63
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Network Security --> SSL/TLS --> Certificate`."
msgstr ""
"Отидете в :menuselection:`Network Security --> SSL/TLS --> Certificate`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:64
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Certificate` page, click :guilabel:`Update` under "
"the :guilabel:`Self-signed Certificate` section."
msgstr ""
"На страницата :guilabel:`Certificate` кликнете върху :guilabel:`Update` в "
"секцията :guilabel:`Self-signed Certificate`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:66
msgid ""
"Adapt the :guilabel:`Common Name` field to retain only the IP address, then "
"click :guilabel:`Next`, then :guilabel:`OK`. Wait for the printer's lights "
"to stop blinking."
msgstr ""
"Адаптирайте полето :guilabel:`Common Name`, за да остане само IP адресът, "
"след което кликнете върху :guilabel:`Next`, а после върху :guilabel:`OK`. "
"Изчакайте светлините на принтера да спрат да мигат."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:69
msgid "Warning page about the connection privacy on Google Chrome"
msgstr ""
"Предупредителна страница относно поверителността на връзката в Google Chrome"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:74
msgid ""
"The Epson homepage may vary depending on the printer model used. For the "
"Epson TM-m30 ii, log in to the Epson homepage by typing `epson` as the "
"username and the printer's serial number as the password."
msgstr ""
