msgid "Select the relevant POS in the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` field."
msgstr "Изберете съответната каса (POS) в полето :guilabel:`Point of Sale`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:62
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Integration` field to :guilabel:`Cash Machine (Cashdro)`."
msgstr ""
"Задайте полето :guilabel:`Integration` на :guilabel:`Cash Machine (Cashdro)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:63
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Cashdro Settings` tab, enter the Cashdro machine's IP "
"address in the :guilabel:`Cashdro IP` field."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Cashdro Settings` въведете IP адреса на машината "
"Cashdro в полето :guilabel:`Cashdro IP`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:65
msgid ""
"Enter your Cashdro user credentials in the :guilabel:`Cashdro Username` "
"and :guilabel:`Cashdro Password` fields."
msgstr ""
"Въведете потребителските си данни за Cashdro в полетата :guilabel:`Cashdro "
"Username` и :guilabel:`Cashdro Password`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:67
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Cashdro Local Network Access`."
msgstr "Активирайте :guilabel:`Cashdro Local Network Access`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:70
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to use :doc:`Local Network Access <../../"
"hardware_network/pos_lna>`, as it bypasses the need for an :doc:`SSL "
"certificate <../../hardware_network/epos_ssc>`."
msgstr ""
"Силно се препоръчва да използвате :doc:`Local Network Access <../../"
"hardware_network/pos_lna>`, тъй като това заобикаля необходимостта "
"от :doc:`SSL сертификат <../../hardware_network/epos_ssc>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:74
