msgstr ""
"Платежните терминали на DPO Pay не изискват :doc:`IoT система </applications/"
"general/iot>` за работа."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/dpo.rst:16
msgid ""
"The Odoo DPO Pay module is only available for companies operating in the "
