#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/stripe.rst:81
msgid "In case of a Wi-Fi connection, the network must be secured."
msgstr "В случай на Wi-Fi връзка, мрежата трябва да бъде защитена."

