#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:498
msgid "Receipt printing"
msgstr "Печат на касови бележки"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:500
msgid ""
"To allow receipt printing for ongoing orders, go to :menuselection:`Point of "
"Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`, and enable :guilabel:`Early Receipt "
"Printing` under the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` section. Then, from "
"the :ref:`POS register <pos/restaurant/orders>`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`Actions`) icon and select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :guilabel:`Bill` to print the pro forma receipt."
msgstr ""
"За да разрешите отпечатването на касови бележки за текущи поръчки, отидете в "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings` и активирайте "
":guilabel:`Предварително отпечатване на касова бележка` в раздел "
":guilabel:`Точка на продажба`. След това от :ref:`ПОС терминала <pos/"
"restaurant/orders>`, кликнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`Действия`) и изберете :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Сметка`, за да "
"отпечатате проформа бележката."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:506
msgid ""
"After a successful :ref:`order payment <pos/restaurant/bills/payment>`, "
"click :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Print` to generate and print a bill."
msgstr ""
"След успешно :ref:`плащане на поръчка <pos/restaurant/bills/payment>` "
"кликнете върху :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Печат`, за да генерирате и "
"отпечатате сметка."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:510
msgid ""
"If a printer is :doc:`configured and linked <hardware_network/"
"receipt_printers>` to a point of sale, the receipt is automatically printed "
"upon payment confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Ако принтер е :doc:`конфигуриран и свързан <hardware_network/"
