#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:519
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "Бакшиши"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:524
msgid ""
"To allow tipping in a POS, go to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`Payment` section, enable :guilabel:`Tips`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"За да разрешите бакшиши в POS, отидете в :ref:`настройките на POS <pos/use/"
"settings>`, превъртете надолу до секцията :guilabel:`Payment`, "
"активирайте :guilabel:`Tips` и щракнете върху :guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:528
msgid ""
"Depending on your hardware setup and geographical location, enable the "
"following options as relevant:"
msgstr ""
"В зависимост от вашата хардуерна конфигурация и географско местоположение, "
"активирайте следните опции според случая:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:531
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add tip through payment terminal (Adyen)`: Only works with "
"an :doc:`Adyen <payment_methods/terminals/adyen>` card terminal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add tip through payment terminal (Adyen)`: Работи само с карточен "
"терминал :doc:`Adyen <payment_methods/terminals/adyen>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:533
msgid ""
":ref:`Add tip after payment <pos/restaurant/tips-after-payment>`: Only works "
"for a POS in the United States of America with an :doc:`Adyen "
"<payment_methods/terminals/adyen>` or a :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/"
"terminals/stripe>` :ref:`payment terminal <pos/terminals/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Add tip after payment <pos/restaurant/tips-after-payment>`: Работи "
"само за POS в Съединените американски щати с :doc:`Adyen <payment_methods/"
"terminals/adyen>` или :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/terminals/"
"stripe>` :ref:`терминал за плащане <pos/terminals/configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:539
msgid ""
"Saving the :guilabel:`Tips` setting automatically fills the :guilabel:`Tip "
"product` field with the preconfigured :guilabel:`[TIPS] Tips` product, which "
"is only used for tips. When selecting another product in the :guilabel:`Tip "
"product` field, the chosen product is no longer available on the :ref:`POS "
"register <pos/restaurant/orders>`."
msgstr ""
"Запазването на настройката :guilabel:`Tips` автоматично попълва "
"полето :guilabel:`Tip product` с предварително конфигурирания "
"продукт :guilabel:`[TIPS] Tips`, който се използва само за бакшиши. При "
"избиране на друг продукт в полето :guilabel:`Tip product`, избраният продукт "
"вече не е наличен на :ref:`POS регистъра <pos/restaurant/orders>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:547
msgid "Tip and payment"
msgstr "Бакшиш и плащане"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:549
msgid ""
"To process a tip during :ref:`payment <pos/restaurant/bills/payment>`, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"За да обработите бакшиш по време на :ref:`плащане <pos/restaurant/bills/"
"payment>`, следвайте тези стъпки:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:551
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Tip`, then :icon:`fa-eur` "
"(:guilabel:`euro`) to add an amount or :icon:`fa-percent` "
"(:guilabel:`percent`) to add a percentage, and click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Бакшиш`, след това :icon:`fa-eur` "
"(:guilabel:`евро`), за да добавите сума, или :icon:`fa-percent` "
"(:guilabel:`процент`), за добавяне на процент, и "
"кликнете :guilabel:`Потвърждаване`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:557
msgid "The currency symbol reflects your company's configured currency."
msgstr ""
"Символът на валутата отразява конфигурираната валута на вашата компания."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:558
msgid ""
"If the order and the tip are paid using different payment methods, select "
"a :doc:`payment method <payment_methods>` for the order first. Then, select "
"a payment method for the tip, click :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Tip`, add "
"the tip amount, and click :guilabel:`Confirm`. Finally, :guilabel:`Validate` "
"the payment."
msgstr ""
"Ако поръчката и бакшишът се плащат с различни начини на плащане, първо "
"изберете :doc:`начин на плащане <payment_methods>` за поръчката. След това "
"изберете начин на плащане за бакшиша, кликнете :icon:`fa-"
"heart` :guilabel:`Бакшиш`, въведете сумата на бакшиша и "
"кликнете :guilabel:`Потвърждаване`. Накрая :guilabel:`Потвърдете` плащането."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:566
msgid "Tip after payment (US only)"
msgstr "Бакшиш след плащане (само за САЩ)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:568
msgid ""
"To allow tipping after payment for a POS in the United States of America, "
"ensure the :guilabel:`Add tip after payment` setting is enabled in "
"the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`. To process tips after payment, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"За да разрешите бакшиш след плащане за POS в Съединените американски щати, "
"уверете се, че настройката :guilabel:`Add tip after payment` е активирана "
"в :ref:`настройките на POS <pos/use/settings>`. За да обработите бакшиши "
"след плащане, следвайте тези стъпки:"

