"On the :guilabel:`Payment` screen, select a :guilabel:`Card` payment method "
"linked to a :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/terminals/stripe>` or :doc:`Adyen "
"<payment_methods/terminals/adyen>` terminal."
msgstr ""
"На екрана :guilabel:`Payment` изберете метод на плащане :guilabel:`Card`, "
"свързан с терминал :doc:`Stripe <payment_methods/terminals/stripe>` "
