"The :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab configures the product page on the website. "
"Refer to the :ref:`Product visibility <ecommerce/products/publish-products>` "
"and :ref:`Product configuration <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` "
"sections for the **eCommerce** module for configuration instructions."
msgstr ""
"Разделът :guilabel:`Електронна търговия` конфигурира продуктовата страница "
